let pattern = /(?<=Hello )W3Schools/;

let result = pattern.test(text);

Try it Yourself »

(?<!y)x matches "x" only if "x" is NOT preceded by "y".

Example

let text = "Hello W3Schools";

let pattern = /(?<!Hello )W3Schools/;

let result = pattern.test(text);

Try it Yourself »

